# Fear of Missing Out: "Delirium - Whenever this creature attacks for the first time each turn, if there are four or more
# card types among cards in your graveyard, untap target creature. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase"
# (CR 500.8). The graveyard holds an Ornithopter (artifact creature), a Lightning Bolt (instant) and a Forest the creature's
# own "discard a card" put there (land): four types. On turn 3 it attacks, untaps itself, and attacks again in the
# additional combat phase: 2 and 2, so Bot2 is on 16.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Fear of Missing Out
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

